{#
  ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  _ikigai_switcher.html.j2 — Dropdown del workspace.
  ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Muestra el TITULO del ikigai actual y, al hacer click, despliega:
    - Cada ikigai del workspace (link a su /introspeccion)
    - Separador
    - "+ Nuevo ikigai" (link a /_new)

  Requiere en el contexto (inyectados automaticamente por `ikigai.render`):
    - ikigai_name   (str)   slug del ikigai actual
    - ikigai_url    (str)   prefix completo /u/{name}
    - all_ikigais   (list)  lista de IkigaiInfo del workspace

  Implementacion: <details>/<summary> nativo (zero JS, accesible por default).
  Cierra al hacer click fuera via un pequeno listener inline.
#}
<details class="ikigai-switcher relative">
  <summary class="list-none cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md hover:bg-ink-10 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-100 focus:ring-opacity-30 select-none"
           aria-label="Cambiar de ikigai">
    <span class="text-base leading-none" aria-hidden="true">🌷</span>
    <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-160 truncate max-w-[16ch]">
      {%- for info in all_ikigais -%}
        {%- if info.name == ikigai_name -%}{{ info.title }}{%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ ikigai_name }}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </span>
    <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-ink-100" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M3 4.5L6 7.5L9 4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>
  </summary>
  <div class="absolute left-0 top-full mt-1 w-64 bg-white border border-ink-50 rounded-lg shadow-lg py-1 z-40">
    <ul class="max-h-72 overflow-y-auto" role="listbox" aria-label="Ikigais disponibles">
      {% for info in all_ikigais %}
        {% set is_current = info.name == ikigai_name %}
        <li role="option" aria-selected="{{ 'true' if is_current else 'false' }}">
          <a href="/u/{{ info.name }}/introspeccion"
             class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 hover:bg-brand-10 text-sm {{ 'bg-brand-10 font-semibold' if is_current else '' }}">
            <span class="text-base leading-none" aria-hidden="true">🌷</span>
            <span class="flex-1 truncate text-ink-160">{{ info.title }}</span>
            {% if is_current %}
              <span class="text-xs text-brand-100" aria-label="Actual">●</span>
            {% endif %}
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="border-t border-ink-50 mt-1 pt-1">
      <a href="/_new"
         class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 hover:bg-success-10 text-sm font-medium text-success-110">
        <span class="text-base leading-none" aria-hidden="true">➕</span>
        <span>Nuevo ikigai…</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>
<script>
  // Close <details> dropdown al hacer click fuera. UI nativa de <details> no
  // soporta esto de forma nativa pero es trivial via document listener.
  (function() {
    const dropdown = document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;
    if (!dropdown || dropdown.tagName !== "DETAILS") return;
    document.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
      if (!dropdown.contains(e.target)) dropdown.open = false;
    });
  })();
</script>
